# =============================================================================
# Drasi Server OTel Observability - HTTP Requests
# =============================================================================
# Use with the VSCode REST Client extension (humao.rest-client) or similar.
# API documentation is served at http://localhost:8380/api/v1/docs/

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8380
@dashboardUrl = http://localhost:3000
@checkoutUrl = http://localhost:18080

### ==========================================================================
### Health & Info
### ==========================================================================

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List API versions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/versions

### ==========================================================================
### Sources
### ==========================================================================

### List all sources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sources

### Get the PostgreSQL SLO source status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sources/slo

### Get the Kubernetes source status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sources/k8s

### Get the OTel source status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sources/otel

### ==========================================================================
### Continuous Queries
### ==========================================================================

### List all queries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/queries

### Current health (always-on deployment/metric view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/queries/current-health/results

### Active SLO alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/queries/slo-alert/results

### Service dependency edges
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/queries/service-dependencies/results

### Missing heartbeats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/queries/missing-heartbeat/results

### ==========================================================================
### Reactions
### ==========================================================================

### List all reactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reactions

### Get the dashboard reaction status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reactions/otel-observability-dashboard

### Seeded dashboards
GET {{dashboardUrl}}/api/dashboards

### ==========================================================================
### Checkout control API (mock service)
### ==========================================================================

### Current checkout mock state
GET {{checkoutUrl}}/state

### Spike checkout p99 latency to 920ms
POST {{checkoutUrl}}/latency/920

### Recover checkout p99 latency to 700ms
POST {{checkoutUrl}}/latency/700

### Restore healthy checkout p99 latency
POST {{checkoutUrl}}/latency/400

### Stop checkout heartbeats
POST {{checkoutUrl}}/heartbeat/off

### Resume checkout heartbeats
POST {{checkoutUrl}}/heartbeat/on
